zeebx: faster transforms and media polling on the A53 (dArkOS RG52 Mini)

IBitmap transforms copy the source row by row and write the target directly (a fifth of
the core's time in Action Hero 3D went to per-pixel get_pixel/set_pixel_native), and
poll_media looks at the live IMedia list at most every half millisecond of the game's
clock (8%). Ported on 2026-11-21 to v0.6.0, where the code was translated to English; the
logic is unchanged.

